{
  "_comment": [
    "The module map for game/, and the dependency direction each module is allowed",
    "to point in. scripts/check-modules.py enforces it; docs/ARCHITECTURE.md explains it.",
    "",
    "Every module names the CMake target that ships it ('targets'), so a wrong-way",
    "edge is a link error as well as a failure here. Where several modules share one",
    "archive (unit_catalog / registries / world in soi_world; simulation / session in",
    "game_sim) this file is the only thing that keeps them apart. check-modules.py",
    "also fails if game/CMakeLists.txt puts a source in a target its module does not",
    "name, so the two descriptions of the split cannot drift.",
    "",
    "'modules' is ordered bottom-up: a module may only use modules listed before it,",
    "and only those named in its 'may_use'. There is no tolerated backlog."
  ],
  "modules": {
    "domain_types": {
      "targets": ["engine_core"],
      "_comment": [
        "The vocabulary: enumerations and plain value types with no dependencies of",
        "their own -- what a troop is, what a nation is, what a resource is.",
        "",
        "They are scattered across game/systems, game/units and game/wildlife by",
        "directory, but they belong to no layer in particular because every layer",
        "names them. component.h stores a SpawnType and a NationID; that is not the",
        "ECS reaching into gameplay, it is a struct holding a value. Classifying them",
        "here separates that from the real edges -- world.cpp calling OwnerRegistry is",
        "a cycle, component.h naming an enum is not."
      ],
      "files": [
        "game/systems/nation_id",
        "game/systems/projectile_kind",
        "game/systems/resource_types",
        "game/systems/harvest_yields",
        "game/systems/builder_product_types",
        "game/systems/harvest_yields",
        "game/units/spawn_type",
        "game/units/troop_type",
        "game/wildlife/wildlife_species",
        "game/formation/unit_layout_state",
        "game/systems/nav_grid_types",
        "game/formation/formation_roles",
        "game/formation/army_formation_types",
        "game/audio/cue_ids"
      ],
      "may_use": []
    },
    "components": {
      "targets": ["engine_core"],
      "paths": ["game/core/", "game/accessibility/"],
      "files": [
        "game/game_config",
        "game/camera_framing",
        "game/systems/unit_activity",
        "game/util/asset_text",
        "game/util/json_vec_utils",
        "game/session/simulation_clock",
        "game/session/deterministic_rng",
        "game/core/ambient_session"
      ],
      "may_use": ["domain_types"]
    },
    "unit_catalog": {
      "targets": ["soi_world"],
      "_comment": [
        "What a unit type *is*: the troop, spawn and building enumerations and the",
        "catalogues loaded from assets/. Pure data plus the loader that fills it: the",
        "troop file's formation block is parsed here into a value the formation",
        "registry reads back later, so loading the catalogue needs no formation code."
      ],
      "files": [
        "game/units/building_type",
        "game/units/troop_config",
        "game/units/troop_catalog",
        "game/units/commander_catalog",
        "game/visuals/building_asset_key",
        "game/units/troop_catalog_loader"
      ],
      "may_use": ["domain_types", "components"]
    },
    "registries": {
      "targets": ["soi_world"],
      "_comment": [
        "Cross-cutting lookups and the value types that go with them: who owns a",
        "unit, which nation it belongs to, what occupies a tile, what a troop",
        "profile says. Everything above reads these, so they sit as low as they can",
        "and are allowed to know nothing but components and the catalogues.",
        "",
        "Their instance() accessors resolve through game/core/ambient_session.h,",
        "which the session fills in -- that is why none of them includes the session."
      ],
      "files": [
        "game/systems/building_collision_registry",
        "game/systems/building_line_of_sight",
        "game/systems/combat_rules",
        "game/systems/global_stats_registry",
        "game/systems/healing_colors",
        "game/systems/mission_wave_query",
        "game/systems/nation_loader",
        "game/systems/nation_registry",
        "game/systems/owner_queries",
        "game/systems/owner_registry",
        "game/systems/player_resource_registry",
        "game/systems/projectile",
