    "missions": {
      "targets": ["soi_missions"],
      "_comment": [
        "Reading mission content, and resolving what it names against a map: the",
        "mission file, its victory rules, its wave archetypes, the catalogue that",
        "indexes maps and campaigns, the commander each side is given, and the view",
        "of a definition the menus read.",
        "",
        "It links no AI and no save database on purpose. Reading a mission must not",
        "require a match to be running or a save slot to exist, and that is what",
        "keeps campaign_tests able to check the shipped files on their own."
      ],
      "paths": ["game/mission/"],
