      "_comment": [
        "Picking, the camera services, the minimap layers, the selection controller and",
        "the save metadata writer. These need to unproject or to frame something, so",
        "they consume the kernel and link scene_core. Nothing in the kernel may depend",
        "on them, and neither may render_gl.",
        "",
        "It was five loose files in game/systems/ plus game/view/ and",
        "game/map/minimap/, which meant the module could only be seen by reading three",
        "lists. One directory now, so 'paths' is the whole description."
      ]
